        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7430, Ornate Solid Brass Tassel and Crest Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOrnately styled with the flowing designs that encompass the circle in the middle, this solid brass cabinet knob, made by Omnia, is both beautiful and elegant. The tassel embellishments only add to the grandeur of the piece. The Omnia 7430 Ornate Solid Brass Tassel and Crest Cabinet Knob is perfect for those looking to add a richness to their homes. It is available in 3 sizes in either polished brass, antique nickel, or shaded bronze.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ornate Crest Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>7430/30:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>7430/38:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>7430/47:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
